p08 : US Blanks 9'9"B (2010 catalog vector extraction; target 113.9 L)
p97 : Intended for longboard shapes from 9’2” to 9’6”, this is a close tolerance blank that will net 24” x 3 1 / “ maximum dimen4 sions. Natural rocker will make a nice all-around longboard shape. Rockers from the previous 9’8” will work well with this blank.
